    {
        "text": "Frostleaf? Frostleaf?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! This is the 2nd Recon Squad....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're currently retreating! But, the enemy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It cut out again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "3rd Recon Squad! Do you copy? 3rd Recon Squad!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#3",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! It's me! Did you get--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been continuously monitoring them from the bridge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need you to ask something to that officer next to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ask her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "'How long does Lungmen intend to keep playing dumb?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll pretend I didn't hear that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we certainly don't have time to waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened? I just went to grab some forms, and you two look all serious now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A new mission?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone... Gear up. It's about time for us to head out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, I'm am formally requesting that the L.G.D. provide assistance to Rhodes Island on this rescue mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may even be dealing with Reunion's new temporary headquarters...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, I believe that our recon squads are still out there fighting, even if we can't see them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
